  m_text: "DEEP DIVER\r\n\"The deeper you go, the richer you get\u2014if you survive.\"\r\n\r\n(This
    screen was meant to have an epic comic explaining the story, but we ran out of
    time! Imagine a grizzled diver staring into the abyss as treasure glows below...)\r\n\r\nHOW
    TO PLAY\r\nYou\u2019re a deep-sea scavenger hunting treasures in the abyss.\r\nRisk
    everything to upgrade your gear and uncover legendary loot.\r\n\r\nCONTROLS\r\nWASD
    \u2192 Move (uses oxygen)\r\n\r\nLEFT CLICK \u2192 Jetpack boost (big oxygen
    cost)\r\n\r\nSPACEBAR \u2192 Jump (no jetpack)\r\n\r\nSURVIVE & UPGRADE\r\nOxygen
    drains faster when moving/jetpacking.\r\n\r\nReturn to the rope to refill oxygen
    and upgrade gear.\r\n\r\nDeeper = better loot... but danger increases too.\r\n\r\nPress
    ENTER to brave the depths!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
